  "compact": "Small spaces (icons, the bottom bar, chips, buttons) show the name, with the plain word on hover, focus and long press and for screen readers.",
  "running_text": "In running text the first mention on a screen shows the plain word in brackets; later mentions are marked and explain themselves on hover, focus and long press.",
  "basic_phone": "Basic-phone menus show the plain word first.",
  "plain_first": "A person may choose plain words first in their account, and the owner may switch it on for the business's devices."
 },
