  {
   "place": "customers",
   "how": "Storefront, payment, queue, survey and card pages explain names like every screen; printed receipts and documents sent to customers end with one line per Lynk name they show, \"LynkCheckout: Pay links & QR\" (core/names.py paper_lines). Fiscal documents keep the tax authority's layout.",
   "build_section": "4"
  },
  {
