   "how": "Support cases, the Partner Hub and every staff tool mark names like every screen.",
   "build_section": "12"
  },
  {
   "place": "search_engines",
   "how": "Product pages, link previews and app store text lead with the name and its plain word, \"LynkStat: Analytics for every business\"; every name, plain word, description, spoken form and old name is a search word in every language (catalog/search.v1.json names).",
   "build_section": "5"
  },
  {
   "place": "names_page",
   "how": "lynkomni.com/names, \"Names A to Z\": every name with its plain word, what it does and its similar names, in every language, also in help and in the app's search.",
